From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:36:16 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] fossil-hoki: integrate upstream MCU timepiece services

Enable Hoki's Sidekick services and expose explicit MCU handoff through the
Extreme battery saver launcher app. Opening the app only checks capability;
shutdown requires confirmation and failed handoffs show an error. The feature
can be disabled with services.asteroid-desktop.timepiece.enable. Kernel
timezone stays enabled for Android HALs. No idle action enters timepiece mode.
